...@../../_tools/theme
direction: down

user: 사용자 { class: person }
ui: Streamlit UI { class: ours }

pipeline: Product Intelligence Team 구성 {
  class: group
  grid-columns: 5
  team: Intelligence Team { class: ours }
  launch: Launch Analyst { class: ours }
  sentiment: Sentiment Specialist { class: ours }
  metrics: Metrics Specialist { class: ours }
  firecrawl_tool: FirecrawlTools { class: ours }
}

ext_api: 외부 API (OpenAI·Firecrawl) { class: ext }
session: 세션 상태 { class: store }

user -> ui: 키·회사명 입력
ui -> pipeline: team.run
pipeline -> ext_api: API 호출
ui -> session: 응답 저장
